<title>THAILAND: Shinawatra Satelite to launch Thaicom 3.</title>
<headline>Shinawatra Satelite to launch Thaicom 3.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Shinawatra Satellite Plc said on Thursday it will launch Thaicom 3 satellite into orbit on April 12.</p>
<p>Thaicom 3 which was built by Aerospatiale of France will be launched in Kourou, French Guyana, Shinawatra Satellite said in a statement.</p>
<p>The satellite will have the tranmission capacity of 24 C-band and 14 KU-band transponders.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
